<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV MON AUG 4.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV MON AUG 4.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>shares of the following companies will trade ex-dividend on</p>
<p>Monday:</p>
<p>    COMPANY			 DIV/SHARE    ADJUSTED START PRICE</p>
<p>    Nireus		  50 drachmas	  2,400</p>
<p>    Metalloplastiki     40			 730</p>
<p>    Zampa		  250		     2,950</p>
<p>    General Commerce    70			 880</p>
<p>			pref  70			 880</p>
<p>    Uncle Stathis	 60		     1,430</p>
<p>			pref  60		     1,195</p>
<p>    Chipita		130		     4,825</p>
<p>Also on Monday, shares of Chipita and Goody's will</p>
<p>trade ex-bonus. The respective adjusted starting prices will be</p>
<p>the following:</p>
<p>    Goody's					  4,560</p>
<p>    Chipita					  4,825</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
